# What is it
Generates `photo_album_output.txt` to put into your save and `landmarks.sii` to copy into `profiles/PROFILE/album` alongside with `blank.png` to 100% unlock the new Road Atlas. So far only for ATS.

100% vibe coded by Claude

# Usage
Just show it the path to files unpacked from def.scs `--defs def/photo_album`

```
python3 photo_album_gen.py --defs path/to/def/photo_album
```